els provided; (ii) If the supplier has notice of the recipient’s particu- lar purpose for obtaining the data and that the re- cipient is relying on the supplier’s skill or judgment in selecting the supplied data, the supplied data must be fit for the recipient’s particular purpose; and Principle 7 ALI-ELI PRINCIPLES FOR A DATA ECONOMY"